
# 🪐 Hidden Nexus
A social place in Gemspace!

=> /register/ 🌱 Register
=> /feed 📃 Just Browsing!


### What is the Hidden Nexus?
The Hidden Nexus is a place in Gemspace that allows capsuleers, Geminauts, and other explorers of Gemspace to collaborate and communicate together. It was designed from the beginning to provide a clean UI with granular settings to customize the user experience to ones needs.
        
        Register if you would like, or just browse the existing feed!
        Established 2023-08-24, we are currently home to 53 registered users!
        
        With a friendly user experience, powerful settings, and many planned features, it speaks for itself.


## 📰 News

### 2026-01-15
=> gemini://hidden.nexus/gcl/content/ Gemini Capsule Library released!
----------------
Hidden Nexus' dynamic forms and interactivity have been enabled by a project I've made called Gemini Capsule Library!
This Python library allows for easy creation of dynamic forms, as well as the ability to extend functionality to create things such as account registration.

If anyone has any questions on how to use this project, please feel free to email me or post about it!
----------------
### 2023-08-23
=> /captchasubmission/ We're looking for more knowledge questions!
----------------
As you've seen when registering, you're asked a kind of captcha from a list of question/answer pairs.
I've tasked myself and friends with thinking of the ones currently being used, but I would like to ask anyone to contribute!

Registered users can click on title of this news bulletin and submit a question answer pair!
These can be any kind of question category (logic, math, reading comprehention, etc.) as long as they are relatively ACCESSIBLE. In the style of the existing pairs.

I'll go through them and add ones I like to the database of question/answer pairs!
